  "contentval": "000NQzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/1452",
  "contentHtml": "<p>초간단&#160;옴의&#160;법칙&#160;실험&#160;5분&#160;만에&#160;끝내기&#160;+&#160;무선&#160;충전용&#160;전원장치 <br><br><br>2022&#160;개정&#160;교육과정에서&#160;전기단원을&#160;집필하면서&#160;수십년간&#160;바뀌지&#160;않았던&#160;옴의&#160;법칙&#160;실험장치를&#160;바꿔&#160;보았다. <br>아래는&#160;2022&#160;개정교육과정&#160;천재교과서(임성숙)&#160;2학년에&#160;실린&#160;탐구&#160;내용이다. <br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a72d156b73f8744fa1e90d63749c5ebefd1c461\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a72d156b73f8744fa1e90d63749c5ebefd1c461\" data-origin-width=\"1206\" data-origin-height=\"837\"></div><p><br>&#160; <br>실험&#160;장치에&#160;차이점이&#160;보이는가?&#160;실험장치에서&#160;집게&#160;전선이&#160;사라졌다. <br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd744d0324414049bcfe9afc84e54b24a2f228b1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd744d0324414049bcfe9afc84e54b24a2f228b1\" data-origin-width=\"983\" data-origin-height=\"576\"></div><p><br>매번&#160;실험할&#160;때&#160;마다&#160;&#160;접촉불량으로&#160;실험을&#160;실패하게&#160;하고,&#160;실험&#160;준비도&#160;어렵게&#160;만들었던&#160;집게&#160;전선을&#160;없애&#160;버렸다. <br>일단&#160;실험&#160;준비과정을&#160;영상으로&#160;보자.&#160;얼마나&#160;간편한지&#160;아마&#160;감동&#160;받을&#160;것이다.(난&#160;감동&#160;받았다.&#160;^^) <br><a href=\"https://youtube.com/shorts/lCzOJ19aFGQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtube.com/shorts/lCzOJ19aFGQ</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/lCzOJ19aFGQ\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"405\" data-video-height=\"720\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/TQ6hS/hyZMj5nK7v/I1X0W1pRTHIPSdlCGMwWD1/img.jpg?width=405&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_405_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/EFEce/hyZMpR4gp8/Stfqh97WfTW2EhptKTrHIK/img.jpg?width=405&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_405_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"405\" data-video-origin-height=\"720\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lCzOJ19aFGQ\" width=\"405\" height=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><br><br><br>&#160; <br>실험과정도&#160;영상으로&#160;&#160;보자.&#160;긴&#160;니크롬선&#160;짧은&#160;니크롬선으로&#160;바꿔&#160;가며,&#160;전압을&#160;1V&#160;씩&#160;높여&#160;가면서&#160;전류의&#160;변화를&#160;살펴보면&#160;된다.&#160;결과값도&#160;아주&#160;정확하게&#160;나온다.&#160;(너무&#160;간단하지&#160;않은가?) <br><a href=\"https://youtube.com/shorts/J0p7zNeDGB4\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtube.com/shorts/J0p7zNeDGB4</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/J0p7zNeDGB4\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"405\" data-video-height=\"720\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/lYYsW/hyZLhVhjXp/0EL9KglVwuzk7aNI0snbjk/img.jpg?width=405&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_405_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b4Pomw/hyZLoGTEq8/irbLTSggympipIOyFm3ikK/img.jpg?width=405&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_405_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"405\" data-video-origin-height=\"720\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/J0p7zNeDGB4\" width=\"405\" height=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><br><br><br>&#160;교과서&#160;쓰면서&#160;힘든점도&#160;있지만,&#160;무언가&#160;&#160;새로운&#160;과학실험을&#160;바꿀&#160;수&#160;있다는&#160;것에&#160;보람을&#160;느낀다. <br>준비물도&#160;간단하다.&#160;추후에는&#160;상자에&#160;나오겠지만,&#160;불편하면&#160;그냥&#160;지퍼백에&#160;준비물을&#160;넣어서&#160;모둠별로&#160;나눠&#160;줘도&#160;된다. <br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e2203868fd481a28c8a4b1f9aa537f2119f5fb6d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e2203868fd481a28c8a4b1f9aa537f2119f5fb6d\" data-origin-width=\"792\" data-origin-height=\"593\"></div><p><br>쉽게&#160;나눠&#160;주고,&#160;실험이&#160;끝나면&#160;다시&#160;지퍼백이나&#160;플라스틱&#160;상자에&#160;담아서&#160;걷으면&#160;된다.&#160;그리고&#160;1년&#160;보관한&#160;후&#160;내년에&#160;사용하면&#160;된다.&#160;^^ <br><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b426ae26cb0729fa925a675d5ec85147cbbeb5d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b426ae26cb0729fa925a675d5ec85147cbbeb5d\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"864\"></div><p><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&lt;옴의&#160;법칙&#160;실험장치를&#160;준비하면서&#160;생각했던&#160;점이다&gt;</span> <br>&#160; <br><b>1.&#160;집게&#160;전선&#160;대신&#160;자석&#160;연결장치를&#160;이용해서&#160;바로&#160;실험할&#160;수&#160;있게&#160;바꾸어&#160;보았다.</b> <br>&#160;이제&#160;더이상&#160;접촉&#160;불량으로&#160;고민할&#160;필요&#160;없다.</p><p><br><b>2.&#160;전압계와&#160;전류계도&#160;미니&#160;전압계와&#160;전류계로&#160;바꿨다.</b> <br>디지털이&#160;대세이긴&#160;하지만,&#160;디지털의&#160;경우&#160;실제&#160;실험해&#160;보니,&#160;값이&#160;자꾸&#160;요동치면서&#160;변해서&#160;오히려&#160;측정에&#160;방해가&#160;된다.&#160;그렇다고&#160;이&#160;간단한&#160;실험에&#160;MBL을&#160;쓰고&#160;싶지는&#160;않았다. <br>전압계&#160;전류계에&#160;전압&#160;크기를&#160;결정하는&#160;+&#160;전원단자가&#160;1개만&#160;있다.&#160;디지털로&#160;바뀌면서&#160;대부분&#160;전압을&#160;자동으로&#160;측정하기&#160;때문에&#160;아날로그에서도&#160;기존에&#160;하던&#160;것처럼&#160;전원단자를&#160;전압&#160;크기에&#160;따라서&#160;바꿔서&#160;연결할&#160;필요가&#160;없다고&#160;생각했다.&#160;그냥&#160;+&#160;단자&#160;1개만&#160;있다. <br>크기가&#160;작고&#160;공간을&#160;많이&#160;차지&#160;하지&#160;않아서,&#160;실험하기&#160;너무&#160;좋다. <br>2022개정교육과정에서는&#160;전압과&#160;전류의&#160;변화&#160;관계만&#160;살피면&#160;된다.&#160;만약&#160;전압계&#160;전류계를&#160;다른&#160;실험에&#160;사용해야&#160;하는데&#160;측정값이&#160;측정&#160;범위를&#160;넘어&#160;가야&#160;한다면&#160;차라리&#160;디지털&#160;멀티미터를&#160;사용하길&#160;권한다.&#160;</p><p><br><b>3.&#160;저항의&#160;직렬&#160;병렬&#160;연결도&#160;간단하게&#160;해&#160;볼&#160;수&#160;있다.</b> <br>저항의&#160;직렬&#160;병렬&#160;연결에서&#160;전원장치를&#160;사용해도&#160;되지만,&#160;간단하게&#160;전원장치&#160;대신&#160;건전지를&#160;사용할&#160;수&#160;있다(대부분&#160;교과서에서는&#160;건전지를&#160;사용한다).&#160;그리고&#160;오른쪽&#160;병렬&#160;연결처럼&#160;건전지&#160;끼우개를&#160;구입하지&#160;않고&#160;기존에&#160;학교에&#160;있던&#160;건전지끼우개를&#160;이용해도&#160;된다.&#160; <br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc46d60323ae0ab3b3789142259d6086785ea410\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc46d60323ae0ab3b3789142259d6086785ea410\" data-origin-width=\"926\" data-origin-height=\"312\"></div><p><br><br>&#160; <br>참고로&#160;옴의&#160;법칙&#160;제품은&#160;아래&#160;사이트에서&#160;구매할&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160;옴의&#160;법칙&#160;뿐만&#160;아니라&#160;전구의&#160;직렬&#160;병렬&#160;연결도&#160;관찰할&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160;옴의&#160;법칙&#160;세트화&#160;하면서&#160;아래&#160;소개한&#160;전원장치도&#160;필요가&#160;없어졌다.&#160;스마트폰&#160;충전기를&#160;이용하는&#160;미니&#160;전원장치가&#160;들어&#160;있어서&#160;그냥&#160;세트&#160;안에서&#160;다&#160;실험할&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160; <br><a href=\"https://link.gmarket.co.kr/mjGbIzkouh\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://link.gmarket.co.kr/mjGbIzkouh</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"G마켓-옴의법칙 종합 실험 키트 VIR\" data-og-description=\"148,500원\" data-og-host=\"item.gmarket.co.kr\" data-og-source-url=\"https://link.gmarket.co.kr/mjGbIzkouh\" data-og-url=\"https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodsCode=4569104571\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bBLvUO/hyZLnuszjS/AH16xSDDZzSDHLtj1ZLnwk/img.jpg?width=280&amp;height=280&amp;face=0_0_280_280,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ccIkvz/hyZMoyQUx7/mB6AdBElHnMBO10IIT9kD0/img.jpg?width=1720&amp;height=300&amp;face=0_0_1720_300,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/hB4NS/hyZLYofHA4/9jUFLCqszFAZiddhgKyYn1/img.jpg?width=600&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_600_600\"><a href=\"https://link.gmarket.co.kr/mjGbIzkouh\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://link.gmarket.co.kr/mjGbIzkouh\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bBLvUO/hyZLnuszjS/AH16xSDDZzSDHLtj1ZLnwk/img.jpg?width=280&amp;height=280&amp;face=0_0_280_280,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ccIkvz/hyZMoyQUx7/mB6AdBElHnMBO10IIT9kD0/img.jpg?width=1720&amp;height=300&amp;face=0_0_1720_300,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/hB4NS/hyZLYofHA4/9jUFLCqszFAZiddhgKyYn1/img.jpg?width=600&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_600_600\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">G마켓-옴의법칙 종합 실험 키트 VIR</p><p class=\"og-desc\">148,500원</p><p class=\"og-host\">item.gmarket.co.kr</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;&#160;<br>&#160; <br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">4.&#160;마지막으로&#160;전원장치를&#160;무선&#160;충전용&#160;전원장치로&#160;바꾸어&#160;보았다.&#160;</span></p><p><br>(이것도&#160;가장&#160;뿌듯한&#160;일&#160;중&#160;하나다.&#160;학교에&#160;부피만&#160;크게&#160;차지하고&#160;있던&#160;전원장치를&#160;다&#160;대체할&#160;수&#160;있을&#160;듯&#160;하다.) <br>업체와&#160;1년&#160;정도&#160;이야기를&#160;한&#160;것&#160;같다.&#160;몇일전&#160;완성된&#160;제품을&#160;보내&#160;왔다.&#160; <br>기존에&#160;옴의&#160;법칙&#160;실험을&#160;하려면&#160;부피가&#160;크고&#160;유선으로&#160;연결된&#160;전원장치로&#160;인해&#160;불편한&#160;점이&#160;많았다.&#160;이제는&#160;스마트폰&#160;충저기&#160;처럼&#160;충전해&#160;두었다가&#160;사용하면&#160;된다.&#160;크기도&#160;작고&#160;성능도&#160;뛰어&#160;나다. <br>칼이랑&#160;크기를&#160;비교해&#160;보면&#160;크기를&#160;대충&#160;짐작할&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160;더이상&#160;과학실에&#160;전원코드&#160;꼿지&#160;않아도&#160;된다. <br>위에&#160;옴의&#160;법칙&#160;실험&#160;동영상에서도&#160;이&#160;무선&#160;충전용&#160;전원장치를&#160;사용했다. <br>&#160; </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f86253da31276fda2ef5ec31275562313064aa3f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f86253da31276fda2ef5ec31275562313064aa3f\" data-origin-width=\"846\" data-origin-height=\"576\"></div><p><br><br>무선&#160;충전용&#160;전원장치를&#160;이용하면&#160;기존에&#160;과학실험에서&#160;하던&#160;대부분의&#160;실험을&#160;대체할&#160;수&#160;있다. <br>전기분해,&#160;전자기유도,&#160;샤프심&#160;발광,&#160;전해질&#160;실험&#160;등등 <br><br>&#160; <br><b>&lt;관련&#160;참고&#160;자료&gt;&#160;만든지&#160;오래된&#160;자료들이라&#160;다운&#160;받아서&#160;노트북에서만&#160;작동한다.&#160;시간이&#160;되면&#160;웹에서&#160;작동하도록&#160;수정할&#160;예정이다.</b></p><p><br>옴의&#160;법칙&#160;가상실험&#160;(물&#160;모형으로&#160;설명하기) <br><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/1391\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/1391</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"전류,전압,저항 옴의법칙(물과비교) 가상실험\" data-og-description=\"전류와 전압 그리고 저항을 물과 비교하여 설명하곤 한다. 학생들에게 접근하기가 쉽기 때문이다. 오랫동안 설명하던 방법을 프로그램으로 만들어 보았다. 항상 전기단원 시작시 하는 질문? 우\" data-og-host=\"sciencelove.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1391\" data-og-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1391\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b5rpDA/hyZMeCZRJa/pVwB0Fj24JOM5zdDZyv90K/img.jpg?width=536&amp;height=393&amp;face=0_0_536_393,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cpu2A9/hyZLg9TExr/UfIA45tobvRbrg0539I8A1/img.jpg?width=536&amp;height=393&amp;face=0_0_536_393,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/9tENC/hyZMn00ocC/oyVN8asIW5r4HgixBEmdD1/img.jpg?width=536&amp;height=393&amp;face=0_0_536_393\"><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/1391\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1391\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b5rpDA/hyZMeCZRJa/